{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"agent_message","text":"The first dry run exposed one issue worth fixing before I stop: the low and mid betas are still too conservative in realized NFE on a contract-level simulation, which violates the target-band discipline even if the policy logic is sound. I’m tightening the beta schedules and tail allocation now so `0.25` and `0.5` spend closer to their intended bands with useful confirmation steps rather than dead slack."}}
