n action +1.42; mean Δreward=-0.000137; mean Δnfe=+1.14 | 2 cases; mean action -1.85; mean Δreward=+0.000097; mean Δnfe=+1.21 |\n| `prune` | 1 cases; mean action +0.99; mean Δreward=+0.001257; mean Δnfe=+3.50 | 3 cases; mean action -0.84; mean Δreward=-0.002800; mean Δnfe=+0.43 |\n\nBy-beta action effect summaries:\n\n| beta | action | direction | cases | mean_action_delta | mean_delta_reward | mean_delta_nfe |\n| ---: | --- | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| 0.000 | `prune` | decrease | 1 | -0.58 | 0.000000 | 0.000 |\n| 0.250 | `forward` | decrease | 1 | -7.04 | 0.000061 | 1.864 |\n| 0.250 | `forward` | increase | 1 | 1.00 | -0.009947 | 0.056 |\n| 0.250 | `preview` | increase | 1 | 1.91 | 0.000061 | 1.864 |\n| 0.250 | `prune` | decrease | 1 | -0.97 | -0.009947 | 0.056 |\n| 0.500 | `forward` | decrease | 1 | -11.96 | 0.001257 | 3.496 |\n| 0.500 | `forward` | increase | 1 | 2.31 | 0.001545 | 1.240 |\n| 0.500 | `preview` | increase | 2 | 2.19 | 0.001401 | 2.368 |\n| 0.500 | `prune` | decrease | 1 | -0.99 | 0.001545 | 1.240 |\n| 0.500 | `prune` | increase | 1 | 0.99 | 0.001257 | 3.496 |\n| 0.750 | `backward` | decrease | 1 | -1.60 | -0.000116 | 1.164 |\n| 0.750 | `backward` | increase | 1 | 1.50 | -0.000300 | 1.752 |\n| 0.750 | `forward` | decrease | 1 | -21.24 | -0.000116 | 1.164 |\n| 0.750 | `forward` | increase | 1 | 3.18 | -0.000300 | 1.752 |\n| 0.750 | `preview` | increase | 1 | 4.41 | -0.000116 | 1.164 |\n| 1.000 | `backward` | decrease | 1 | -2.10 | 0.000310 | 1.258 |\n| 1.000 | `backward` | increase | 1 | 1.34 | 0.000026 | 0.520 |\n| 1.000 | `forward` | decrease | 1 | -31.35 | 0.000310 | 1.258 |\n| 1.000 | `forward` | increase | 1 | 3.15 | 0.000026 | 0.520 |\n| 1.000 | `preview` | decrease | 1 | -0.85 | 0.000026 | 0.520 |\n| 1.000 | `preview` | increase | 1 | 6.82 | 0.000310 | 1.258 |\n\nRecent concrete examples:\n\n| change | beta | action_delta | delta_reward | delta_nfe | note |\n| --- | ---: | --- | ---: | ---: | --- |\n| r0001->r0002 | 0.250 | forward 